00:05:38.100 --> 00:05:40.280
Uh, and it is a, it is a long game.

00:05:40.280 --> 00:05:49.380
It's even long by like the YouTube long play standards of like, when you look at these games and someone plays it perfectly and it's like, yep, that was 33 minutes.

00:05:49.400 --> 00:05:52.020
