If it's your first time playing, it's going to take you hours to figure that shit out.

00:05:54.880 --> 00:06:03.320
But for two hours and 55 minutes of perfect gameplay, that's got to be like, what, like 20 hours of real life?

00:06:04.380 --> 00:06:13.040
I mean, maybe I, I, I would say I played this game for a solid hour and a half.

00:06:13.700 --> 00:06:21.140
Uh, and then I, I think I, I didn't even see like modes of this game.

00:06:21.940 --> 00:06:26.440
