00:07:19.880 --> 00:07:22.920
And then I'm going to go in and I'm going to do these things.

00:07:22.920 --> 00:07:29.920
But right after you do this tutorial, you're thrown into the side scrolling action platformer part of the game where none of that shit matters.

00:07:30.060 --> 00:07:31.400
And the enemies are everywhere.

00:07:32.220 --> 00:07:35.000
And, you know, you're in a side scrolling game.

00:07:35.060 --> 00:07:36.300
So you're going to think this to go to the right.

00:07:36.420 --> 00:07:46.000
But if you go all the way to the right in, as far as you can in the first stage, you just get greeted by a woman who's looking for a robe that happens to be all the way to the left.

00:07:46.180 --> 00:07:47.580
