00:07:49.580 --> 00:08:08.500
I guess what made me understand that I would have to actually explore this map, which, again, everything else about sort of the grammar of the game that you're looking at makes you think that this is a just go right and punch dudes game.

00:08:09.060 --> 00:08:22.540
