00:11:49.540 --> 00:11:51.800
Yeah, like, it, exactly.

00:11:52.500 --> 00:11:55.920
You've been shown this whole system for one-on-one fighting.

00:11:56.200 --> 00:12:03.580
And apparently that's reserved for bosses after you beat them with, like, the normal control scheme.

00:12:03.580 --> 00:12:13.580
And then when you actually get into the level proper, like, it's just that thing that we thought that we left behind in, like, in the 80s,

00:12:13.620 --> 00:12:18.340
which was just infinitely spawning enemies running straight at you.

00:12:18.560 --> 00:12:28.980
Some of them actually don't run straight at you and will always hit you because of your hurt boxes and their hit boxes just don't line up.

