00:12:39.220 --> 00:12:43.000
And I feel like it wouldn't have killed them to have the tutorial explain a little bit of that, too.

00:12:43.100 --> 00:12:47.440
Like, if you're going to go through the trouble or, like, tutorialize these things as they're about to happen.

00:12:47.620 --> 00:12:50.520
So first explain, like, the action part of the game.

00:12:50.520 --> 00:12:54.980
And then, like, when the time comes for a one-on-one fight, that's the moment to, like, learn that.

00:12:55.140 --> 00:12:58.240
Not, okay, and then don't forget this 45 minutes later.

00:13:00.760 --> 00:13:09.280
And if you start the game and happen to pause, you'll notice that there are a ton of different menus you can access as well.

00:13:09.280 --> 00:13:14.820
