It's really important to understand how this works because once you build it up to 100%, you gain access to attacks that are way more useful, specifically for the boss fights.

00:13:45.860 --> 00:13:52.160
The kind of thing that you don't want to just use your super attack on, like, some random enemy.

00:13:52.160 --> 00:13:56.020
You want to save it for the boss fight so this way you can take care of it a lot quicker.

